<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan CPC February petrochemical prices.</title>
<headline>Taiwan CPC February petrochemical prices.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp on Thursday published its product prices for February.</p>
<p>The prices, announced at the end of each month, apply retroactively to products sold during the month.</p>
<p>(in U.S. dollars per tonne)</p>
<p> PRODUCT					February  January</p>
<p> ethylene					    572	587</p>
<p> polymer grade propylene			 449	460</p>
<p> chemical grade propylene			416	427</p>
<p> butadiene					   448	480</p>
<p> benzene					     329	322</p>
<p> paraxylene					  455	468</p>
<p> orthoxylene					 409	413</p>
<p> carbon black feedstock (per kilolitre)    112	124</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815) (c) Reuters Limited 1997</p>
